 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Finitely many algebraic elements generate a finite extension",
 "statement": "Let $k\\subseteq\\Omega$ be fields [def-pc-field-extension] and $\\alpha_1,\\dots,\\alpha_n\\in\\Omega$ elements algebraic over $k$ [def-weil-algebraic-element]. Then the subfield $k(\\alpha_1,\\dots,\\alpha_n)\\subseteq\\Omega$ generated by $k$ and the $\\alpha_i$ is a finite extension of $k$: it is a finite-dimensional $k$-vector space.",
